TestCase subclass: #Poly1305Test
	instanceVariableNames: ''
	classVariableNames: ''
	package: 'Tests-Crypto'!

Poly1305Test comment: 'Poly1305 against RFC 8439''s example (2.5.2) and test vectors (A.3, #5 to #11 the edge cases of the reduction modulo 2^130 - 5 and of adding s), incremental use split at every byte, digest that goes on, a key of the wrong size.'!

!Poly1305Test methodsFor: 'tests'!
testRfc8439Example
	self assert: (Poly1305 key: (ByteArray fromHex: '85d6be7857556d337f4452fe42d506a80103808afb0db2fd4abff6af4149f51b') message: 'Cryptographic Forum Research Group' asByteArray) equals: (ByteArray fromHex: 'a8061dc1305136c6c22b8baf0c0127a9')
!
testRfc8439Vector1
